---
manual: intro.hello_one_liner
lines: [12, 21]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app { button("Click me!") { alert("Good job.") } }
----------- test code
box = layout_of(button)
assert_operator box.w, :>, 0, "the button is on show"
assert_empty dialog_calls

click_on "Click me!"

assert_equal [[:alert, "Good job."]], dialog_calls, "a real click on the button pops up the message"
